{"version":1,"content":"<p>上午10時許，一名女子報案在深水埗福榮街120號一單位遭一名中年男子持凳襲擊，並搶去500元。</p><p>警員到場調查，女事主手腳受傷，清醒送往明愛醫院，並當場截獲涉案男子，涉嫌毆打及刑事毁壞被捕。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T06:41:47.771769+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":94,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T06:29:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T20:37:57.039585+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T06:37:52.017527+00:00","content_hash":"b7e6e79f7698da4467157f77bfdb9db2c26bc4f3fb43f01402c0faed4341eea0","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}